abstract: >-
  Final supplementary analysis code, pseudonymized derived gait and
  clinical-feature tables, and machine-readable results accompanying the
  accepted NeurIPS 2026 paper "Interpretable Machine Learning Evaluates
  Differential Therapy Effects in Parkinsonian Gait". Original code is MIT
  licensed; author-produced derived data, results, and documentation are
  CC BY 4.0. Consult the separate LICENSE-CODE, LICENSE-DATA, and
  LICENSE-CONTENT files for their respective scopes.
